The '''Port Nou commune district''' ({{langx|bl|Distrito comuna Port Nou}}) is one of the 17 [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the [[Canyars]] [[Regions of Balisca|region of Estuaria]] (61). Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the {{W|instant-runoff voting}} system.

